WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
Akuma blocks Ryu’s OD Shoryuken before the punish.

2
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:02.850
Heavy Adamant Flame hits Ryu’s recovery as a Punish Counter.

3
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.550
Back heavy kick launches Ryu after the punish.

4
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.050
OD Demon Flip carries Akuma toward the airborne opponent.

5
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.150
The Demon Flip kick follow-up hits the airborne Ryu.

6
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.550
Heavy Tatsu continues the juggle after the kick follow-up.

7
00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:08.300
Ryu recovers after the Demon Flip conversion.
